title: marry
---
<<cam GraveCam>>
Someone places a contract before you.
You are too overwhelmed, so you just sign it without reading.
Suddenly...
There's bells chiming.
There's confetti flying.
There is an organ playing.
People are cheering.
Someone takes your hand.
<<if $charname == "Dr. h.c. Dr. med. Dr. iur. Dr. phil. Acula">>
    <<sprite "drac">>
    <<theme "drac">>
    It's surprisingly cold.
    {$charname}: You know, I was actually planning on just sucking you dry.
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: But for some godforsaken reason you managed to actually make me like you.
    You: Thanks, I guess?
    {$charname}: I think we will get along splendidly.
    She cosies up to you.
    Somehow you believe her wholeheartedly.
<<elseif $charname == "Bobo Blocksberg">>
    <<sprite "witch">>
    <<theme "witch">>
    It's surprisingly green.
    {$charname}: You know, I was actually planning on using your organs as ingredients for my potions.
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: But I guess somehow you charmed your way into my heart.
    You:  Umm... thanks?
    {$charname}: I am sure that we can make this marriage thing work for us.
    He grins and ... is that his hand on your ass?
    You grin back.
    You: Oh, you bet we will.
<<elseif $charname == "Mothperson">>
    <<sprite "moth">>
    <<theme "moth">>
    It's surprisingly fuzzy.
    {$charname}: You know, I was actually planning on sacrificing you to the Great Lämp.
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: But now I see, that you are the light of my life.
    You: No offence to the Great Lämp of course.
    {$charname}: Of kós.
    You are looking forwards to cozy D&D sessions and the occasional human sacrifice.
    The future seems bright.
<<elseif $charname == "Fishy McFishface">>
    <<sprite "fish">>
    <<theme "fish">>
    It's surprisingly wet.
    {$charname}: You know, I was actually planning on just eating you.
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: And I don't mean eating you out.
    {$charname}: Just literally eating you.
    {$charname}: But you showed me that it would be much more fun to do the former with you.
    He winks.
    You feel simultaneously aroused and insulted.
    {$charname}: Don't worry, there is a lot of oxygen rooms for you in my unterwater castle.
    You: Okay, thanks?
    {$charname}: But don't forget your inhaler.
    {$charname}: Because I will make you gasp for air everyday.
    It's a stupid joke but it makes you giddy anyways.
    You can hardly wait.
<<elseif $charname == "Muscle Mummy">>
    <<sprite "mum">>
    <<theme "mum">>
    It's surprisingly muscular.
    {$charname}: You know, I was actually planning on grinding your body into powder and putting it in my protein shakes.
    You: Huh?
    {$charname}: But now I know, that we are stronger together.
    You: Thanks?
    {$charname}: And now we will get even stronger.
    You: And dominate the world.
    {$charname}: And crush our enemies.
    She pulls you close.
    You feel incredibly safe.
<<endif>>
...
What?
Did you think something terrible would happen?
Did you think that this is some kind of horror game where you get killed when you least expect it?
Just when you have reached your happy ending?
Well...
Looks like...
<<cam BaitCam>>
===